DESCRIPTION:The Ride MORE Bicycles Saturday Shop Ride is a weekly road gro
 up ride that leaves the shop at 59 E Gregory St. in Pensacola. It covers 
 about 30 miles at a 17-19 mph average\, with sprints and regrouping spots
 . The ride runs 7:30-9:30 AM every Saturday and road bikes are required.\
